      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the wedding arch, the officiant asks Nikita if he takes Katya as his wife, and Nikita gladly agrees. But when Katya looks into Nikita's eyes and receives Sveta's video message on her phone, she realizes she loves Denis and calls off the wedding.",
